    "description": "Curated runway data overlay for /api/airports/:icao and /api/runways. Authoritative dimensions and surface from FAA Form 5010 via AirNav.com; OSM Overpass still supplies the centerline geometry per runway (matched by `ref`, leading zeros stripped). When OSM has no matching way for a curated ref, the runway emits with `centerline: []`. `elev_ft` is the published surface elevation (MSL, ft), used by the per-flight verified_alt offset to back out ADS-B reporting drift — when a flight passes over the runway at low altitude its reported alt should match elev_ft; the delta becomes that flight's correction.",
